- * reached. Where GR1 lives is not a guess: the downstream qsmmu-v500 driver
- * (MiCode/Xiaomi_Kernel_OpenSource, polaris-o-oss, drivers/iommu/arm-smmu.c)
- * derives it from the DT resource itself:
- *
- *   #define ARM_SMMU_CB_BASE(smmu)  ((smmu)->base + ((smmu)->size >> 1))
- *   #define ARM_SMMU_CB(smmu, n)    ((n) * (1 << (smmu)->pgshift))
- *   #define ARM_SMMU_CB_FSR         0x58
- *   #define ARM_SMMU_CB_FAR         0x60
